    "updated_at": "2019-03-28T15:51:05Z",
    "body": "`before` and `after` might not be ideal concepts as they are locale dependant (and could change per locale). It might be worth instead expressing the unit type as part of the input, for some background research take a look at the unicode [CLDR for units](http://cldr.unicode.org/translation/units), [`Intl.NumberFormat`](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/Global_Objects/NumberFormat), etc.",
